  "headline": "Prabowo Subianto To Submit Two VP Candidates To MPR On Nov 25",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Subianto To Submit Two VP Candidates To MPR",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto plans to present two vice presidential candidates to the MPR on November 25, prompting the formation of a verification team.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto is scheduled to present two vice presidential candidates to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) on November 25.",
    "The MPR has established a verification team divided into three working groups to evaluate the requirements of the candidates.",
    "The Corruption Eradication Commission (KPK) has indicated its readiness to assist the MPR team in verifying the data of potential candidates."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following the vacancy left by the previous vice president, President Prabowo Subianto has moved to initiate the selection process for a successor. The MPR has mobilized a dedicated verification team tasked with reviewing candidate credentials within a one-week timeframe, structured into three distinct working groups. Public discourse regarding potential nominees has highlighted various figures, including Sufmi Dasco Ahmad, whose legislative experience and political influence are frequently noted by political observers and coalition members. Discussions among stakeholders suggest that the selection criteria should prioritize candidates who are acceptable to the governing coalition and possess a strong grasp of economic issues. The process has garnered broad media attention as the administration prepares to formalize the submission of these two names to the MPR for parliamentary review, with institutional support from the KPK offered for the verification phase.",
